{"id":3,"createdAt":"{D-6}T12:00:00.000Z","title":"gaza, markets, ai, elections, fires, rates, extra topic","content":"## top stories\n<u>**gaza aid convoy**</u>\nAid convoys entered Gaza.\n\nUN officials welcomed it.\n<u>**market rally**</u>\nStocks rose 100% of the forecast gain.\n## more news\n<u>**ai chip export rules**</u>\nNew rules were drafted.\n## in brief\n<u>**local election**</u>\nTurnout was low.","tldrProse":"A quiet day. Markets beat 100% of the forecast.","usedArticles":3,"usedSources":2,"sources":[{"name":"Alpha News","articles":[{"title":"alpha article 04","url":"https://alpha.example.com/04"}]},{"name":"Beta Wire","articles":[{"title":"beta article 103","url":"https://beta.example.com/103"}]}],"sourceArticleCount":2}
